  "id": "fields-thinned",
  "title": "Fields 2025 — thinned field polygons (test)",
  "description": "TEST — every 2025 Fields of the World PRUE field polygon (1.58B), z0–13, through tylertoo's generalization ladder from z0 (density thinning + simplification + tile-size cap). Layer `fields` with per-field `area` (m²), `confidence` (0–100, sparse), `country`, `state`. Built pre-dedupe (issue #9) and unfiltered; superseded by the per-year handover archives once they land. Styles: plain boundaries (default), per-field confidence, per-field size.",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
